  <Placemark>
    <name>MAXIM U.S.A.</name>
    <Snippet maxLines="2" id="khSnippet2796">
    </Snippet>
    <description><![CDATA[<img src="http://www.maximonline.com/maximusa/maxim_logo.jpg">
<br><br>
<center>
<table border=0 width=224>
<tr>
<td>
To celebrate the 100th issue of America's Favorite Magazine, <i>Maxim</i> pulled out the stops and built the largest cover on earth, stretching 110 feet on the desert floor, outside of Las Vegas.
<br><br>
 The cover features "TV's Sexiest Earthling" Eva Longoria, who is one of the most beloved women in America. For more of Eva, and thousands more women we love, log onto <a href="http://www.maximonline.com/index.aspx?src=earth" target="new"><b>www.maximonline.com</b></a>. And for the best travel information on Las Vegas go to <a href="http://www.visitlasvegas.com" target="new"><b>www.VisitLasVegas.com</b></a>. 
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</center>]]></description>
